    "content": "<p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"4e8c550c4bbe952e696b137e1c6bafea\" title=\"自媒体-1000x1000.jpg\" alt=\"自媒体-1000x1000.jpg\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/siren/pic/20220713/4e8c550c4bbe952e696b137e1c6bafea.jpg\"/></div><p><span style=\"color:#cccccc\">就像我们的祖先，</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#cccccc\">那些勇敢的开拓者驱使着驮兽们，</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#cccccc\">让文明征服了荒野——</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#cccccc\">我们也将驱使这头由技术创造的猛兽，</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#cccccc\">拓展文明的边界。</span></p>",
